ticle>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"clients\">\n      <div class=\"section-container\">\n        <div class=\"clients-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"section-head\">\n            <div class=\"section-tag\">Cross-Platform</div>\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">全平台客户端接入</h2>\n            <p class=\"section-desc\">免流(MaTrix)输出通用订阅格式，适配行业开源核心与标准客户端。</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"clients-grid\">\n            <div class=\"client-item\">\n              <h3 class=\"client-os\">Windows</h3>\n              <p class=\"client-desc\">支持通用 Clash 核心及图形客户端，支持系统代理与 TUN 模式。</p>\n              <span class=\"client-status\">通用标准配置</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"client-item\">\n              <h3 class=\"client-os\">macOS</h3>\n              <p class=\"client-desc\">兼容开源原生应用，低内存占用，支持按应用分流规则。</p>\n              <span class=\"client-status\">通用标准配置</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"client-item\">\n              <h3 class=\"client-os\">Android</h3>\n              <p class=\"client-desc\">导入通用订阅链接，开机自启，支持分应用代理设置。</p>\n              <span class=\"client-status\">通用标准配置</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"client-item\">\n              <h3 class=\"client-os\">iOS</h3>\n              <p class=\"client-desc\">支持第三方订阅管理工具，扫描二维码或直接写入配置。</p>\n              <span class=\"client-status\">通用标准配置</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"setup\">\n      <div class=\"section-container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <div class=\"section-tag\">Quick Start</div>\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">接入只需三步</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-desc\">简明直接，无需复杂调试。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"steps-layout\">\n          <div class=\"step-card\">\n            <span class=\"step-number\">STEP 01</span>\n            <h3>选定方案并获取凭证</h3>\n            <p>在方案列表中选择符合流量需求的套餐，结算后在控制台获取独有订阅链接。</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"step-card\">\n            <span class=\"step-number\">STEP 02</span>\n            <h3>导入对应客户端</h3>\n            <p>复制订阅链接粘贴到客户端配置栏，或使用客户端相机扫描控制台二维码完成拉取。</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"step-card\">\n            <span class=\"step-number\">STEP 03</span>\n            <h3>选定节点并开启路由</h3>\n            <p>更新节点列表，挑选延时适宜的入口，切换至规则分流模式即可平稳运行。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"faq\">\n      <div class=\"section-container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <div class=\"section-tag\">Questions</div>\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见问题</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-desc\">关于免流(MaTrix)服务的日常说明。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-list\">\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-index\"></div>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">\n              <h3>免流(MaTrix)支持哪些协议与客户端？</h3>\n              <p>系统适配主流通用分流规范，输出标准订阅格式。只要客户端支持标准 Clash 或相关核心配置，均可正常导入解析。</p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-index\"></div>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">\n              <h3>套餐流量耗尽后如何处理？</h3>\n              <p>流量按自然周期重置。如果周期内用量超标，可在控制面板按需重置周期，或直接升级到更高配额的方案。</p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-index\"></div>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">\n              <h3>同时在线设备数如何界定？</h3>\n              <p>系统统计并发活跃连接的终端总数。以旗舰版为例，最多支持 5 台不同设备同时发起数据请求，超出将限制新设备接入。</p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-index\"></div>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">\n              <h3>节点无法更新或连接受阻怎么办？</h3>\n              <p>首先核对本地设备系统时间是否精准同步。其次确认订阅链接是否被本地安全软件拦截，重新拉取最新节点配置即可恢复。</p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  \n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"section-container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-content\">\n        <div>\n          <strong>免流(MaTrix)</strong> © 2025. 规则分流与网络接入服务框架.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-note\">\n          请合理合规使用网络资源，服务内容以实际接入规则为准。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</div>",
